{"title":"Anvil/24","sourceTitle":"Anvil/24/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><ol><li>Junte 5 lingotes e aqueça-os em <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Forge\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Forge\">forge</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Forge\" title=\"Forge\"> </a></span>.</li>\n<li>Para começar a forjar, adicione no máximo 3 lingotes a uma bigorna de uma só vez. O primeiro lingote pode opcionalmente ser substituído por um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Metal_plate\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Metal plate\">plate</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Metal_plate\" title=\"Metal plate\"> </a></span> para completar a camada inferior mais rapidamente.</li>\n<li>Comece moldando a base da bigorna com um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Hammer\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Hammer\">hammer</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Hammer\" title=\"Hammer\"> </a></span>.</li></ol>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261111115615\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.003 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.004 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 64/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 399/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 120/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    1.029      1 -total\n 95.99%    0.988      3 Template:Ll\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wikinew-vs_:pcache:idhash:183563-0!canonical and timestamp 20261111115615 and revision id 397181. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","sections":[],"revid":397181,"sourceUrl":"https://wiki.vintagestory.at/index.php?title=Anvil%2F24%2Fpt-br","capturedAt":"2026-11-11T11:56:16.270Z"}